OL,3,GNEWSAReform's leader in Scotland
OL,4,AMalcolm Offord reveals cancer diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK's leader in Scotland has
OL,7,Frevealed he was diagnosed with prostate
OL,8,Fcancer on the day of the Holyrood
OL,9,Felection on 7 May.
OL,11,FMalcolm Offord said he had a procedure
OL,12,Flast week to remove his prostate and
OL,13,Fwas now "clear" and "raring to go".
OL,15,FSpeaking to comedian Matt Forde at the
OL,16,FEdinburgh Festival Fringe, he said
OL,17,Fbeing diagnosed with cancer was a
OL,18,F"scary thing" and urged men to "just
OL,19,Fget checked".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
